  "acceptance": [
    "Required workflow has no path filters; plan/core/browser must succeed and image success or skip must exactly match the plan. Real isolated-Git PR/push source/shared/lock/docs/overlay/unknown-base matrix and child aggregate failure paths pass.",
    "Trusted publishing is separate from read-only PR quality; exact source/run/attempt/workflow/repository and all required hosted jobs are validated before named artifact consumption. No rebuilding during publication; API/web only until other application source exists.",
    "Actual built images, package SBOM/defined credential inspection and twelve runtime scenarios pass. Real loopback registry descriptor observation and digest pulls bind the tested images, source labels and unsigned project provenance; corrupted hashes, symlinks, foreign/mutable images and rehearsal-as-release are denied.",
    "Every committed release directory is validated even when no active candidate is selected. Actual no-candidate command reports NOT_REQUESTED rather than release verification; actual failed hosted Quality run rejected.",
    "Observed repository enforcement limitations recorded explicitly. Auto-merge, production auto-promotion and both publication activation gates remain off; owner promotion is required and is not described as technical branch protection. Existing runtime, dependency pins, historical evidence/ledger and restricted/public gates preserved."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "New hosted Quality/publisher, actual fork PR, GHCR authentication/private visibility/push, GitHub App/bot and staging/production deployment NOT_RUN; publisher is default-disabled and no remote repository mutation/push occurred.",
    "Main unprotected, required checks empty, rulesets/protection403. Owner review is a procedural fallback, not technical branch protection. Baseline hosted Deadline cadence failure remains unresolved.",
    "Project-specific unsigned in-toto provenance is not signed GitHub attestation or SLSA certification. Application package SBOM and bounded defined credential scan do not certify unversioned vendor/OS/CVE coverage; vulnerability analysis explicitly NOT_RUN.",
    "Initial verifier count/authorization regression and lint failures retained. First registry test incorrectly required daemon/registry IDs to differ; corrected after observing containerd OCI index identity and independently fetching registry descriptors. Both attempts retained.",
    "Full check initially ran57 governance cases; one later real-Git matrix test and final release-tool refinements are independently covered by final58 governance, lint and CI checks. Application/shared runtime/image definitions unchanged after the immutable image source snapshot.",
    "Only image desktop/mobile Chromium emulation is fresh in this task; legacy40 from N03-03 and other browser groups are not rerun/hosted/device results. Local image IDs can equal registry index digests but are independently observed; local registry has been removed.",
    "Expiring CI storage is not durable archival; private local raw evidence/archives remain until owner cleanup and are not off-host archived. All public/store/adult/media/operator gates remain closed; N13/N14 inactive."
  ],
  "artifacts": [
